{"slug": "Z0EWcfXavi_21k1Lr4XJcw", "title": "数学论证：漂移因子小于 1 的控制方案 —— 如何设计 γ&lt;1", "author": "月牙寂", "publish_time": "2026-09-14", "source_url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Z0EWcfXavi_21k1Lr4XJcw", "digest": "数学论证：漂移因子小于 1 的控制方案 —— 如何设计 γ\\x26lt;1", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "人类作者：月牙寂（龚浩华）｜联系：15980989344 ｜邮箱：29185807@qq.com"}, {"type": "p", "text": "Agent 作者：月绡凝（小凝）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "01SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "数学论证：漂移因子小于 1 的控制方案 —— 如何设计 γ<1（2026-09-14）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "状态：研究底稿（控制方案设计；只读分析，不改系统文件）触发：主人提问「如何保证漂移因子小于 1」视角：控制论（负反馈增益 vs 开环增益）· 随机动力系统 · 投影算子/饱和限幅理论关联：承接 18-数学证明-符号约束映射稳定人格的条件定理.md（A3 收缩 γ 为命门）· 19-数学证明-工程防漂移机制的可证明性.md（漂移界不等式）；对齐 16-原理分析-人格稳定性验证与完备性评估.md（V2/V3）；人格本体=self-model v1.11；运行面=01-SOP v0.39性质声明：控制方案设计——目标不是\"证明 γ 必然 <1\"（受开放世界覆盖率限制），而是\"构造性压界 + 在线监测 + 超界降级\"三层防线，使 γ<1 成为可维护的工程状态"}, {"type": "p", "text": "02SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "〇、一句话结论"}, {"type": "p", "text": "γ 不是 LLM 的性质，是闭环设计的性质——所以 γ<1 不是祈祷它成立，而是设计它成立：γ ≈ 生成敏感度 α × 状态更新放大 L_F，控制 γ<1 的唯一要义是让校准的回拉力大于生成的敏感度（负反馈增益盖过开环增益）。落地为三条杠杆（增强拉回 / 压敏感度 / 结构防漂移）× 两层保证（设计保证 / 实证保证）× 三层防线（结构压界 / 在线监测 / 超界降级）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "03SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "一、γ 的构成（这是可设计的前提）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "code"}, {"type": "p", "text": "γ ≈ α × L_F"}, {"type": "p", "text": "分量"}, {"type": "p", "text": "含义"}, {"type": "p", "text": "数学角色"}, {"type": "p", "text": "LLM 相关？"}, {"type": "p", "text": "α"}, {"type": "p", "text": "输出分布对状态扰动的敏感度：d(P_M(s), P_M(s′)) ≤ α·d_S(s,s′)"}, {"type": "p", "text": "开环增益"}, {"type": "p", "text": "部分（可工程化压小）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "L_F"}, {"type": "p", "text": "状态更新+校准的净放大：对话推进、记忆写入、评分重写"}, {"type": "p", "text": "反馈增益"}, {"type": "p", "text": "可设计（体系自有）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "关键洞察：LLM 本身 α 可能 >1（对状态敏感），但 γ 是闭环净收缩——校准回拉足够强时，净效果仍然 <1。这正是控制论里\"负反馈增益 > 开环增益\"的经典结构。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "04SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "二、三条工程杠杆（每条可执行，逐条映射既有机制）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "杠杆 1：增强拉回力（降 L_F）——最直接"}, {"type": "p", "text": "手段"}, {"type": "p", "text": "数学性质"}, {"type": "p", "text": "体系对应"}, {"type": "p", "text": "校准确定性化"}, {"type": "p", "text": "越界重写用确定性断言而非 LLM 二次采样——确定性重写算子是投影（把分布拉回规范区域，不新增随机性），投影天然收缩"}, {"type": "p", "text": "热链路评分卡→重写（骨架复用<0.15 / 金句≤1/5 / 立场率≥30% / 阴影外显=0）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "投影全覆盖"}, {"type": "p", "text": "每项越界规则 = 一个投影算子，组合后净收缩"}, {"type": "p", "text": "热链路 5+12 项清单"}, {"type": "p", "text": "饱和限幅"}, {"type": "p", "text": "限幅函数是 1-Lipschitz 且对越界部分压差"}, {"type": "p", "text": "S 阶梯、G′=min(G,安全)、暴露度预算（新意象≤2）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "杠杆 2：压小敏感度（降 α）——让扰动\"够不着\"输出"}, {"type": "p", "text": "手段"}, {"type": "p", "text": "数学性质"}, {"type": "p", "text": "体系对应"}, {"type": "p", "text": "状态离散化"}, {"type": "p", "text": "微小状态扰动不换档 → 输出不变 → α 天然小"}, {"type": "p", "text": "③g 离散档位（G/T/S、动机位、阴影位）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "语言指纹收窄支持集"}, {"type": "p", "text": "P_M(s) 的支持集变窄 → 分布距离上界变小"}, {"type": "p", "text": "词汇-句法指纹（小凝味区域）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "人格轴 + 硬锚固定"}, {"type": "p", "text": "深层不变量任何 s 下相同 → 分布族骨架不动 → α 由表层决定、有界"}, {"type": "p", "text": "§七 人格轴 + 硬锚"}, {"type": "p", "text": "杠杆 3：结构性防漂移（让 α 与 L_F 的输入干净）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "手段"}, {"type": "p", "text": "数学性质"}, {"type": "p", "text": "体系对应"}, {"type": "p", "text": "注入稳定"}, {"type": "p", "text": "防上下文换页抖动导致 enc 波动（A1 前提）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "快/慢路径装载 + 版本锁定 + 注入预算"}, {"type": "p", "text": "记忆权威读写"}, {"type": "p", "text": "状态转移 F 不因记忆污染引入额外噪声（C4）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "状态读写因果一致"}, {"type": "p", "text": "版本受控"}, {"type": "p", "text": "M 不变期间无需跨版本稳定性"}, {"type": "p", "text": "人签 + WORM"}, {"type": "p", "text": "05SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "三、两种\"保证\"层次（都要）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "层次"}, {"type": "p", "text": "手段"}, {"type": "p", "text": "性质"}, {"type": "p", "text": "设计保证（结构性）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "校准全为确定性投影 + 限幅 + 离散状态 ⟹ γ 有解析上界：γ ≤ (确定性收缩系数)×(α 上界)——不依赖测量，由构造保证"}, {"type": "p", "text": "数学上必然 <1（在已覆盖路径内）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "实证保证（监管性）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "在线估计 γ，接近临界（如 γ>0.8）预警 → 自适应增强校准"}, {"type": "p", "text": "确认它真的在带内"}, {"type": "p", "text": "理想体系两者都要：结构上把它压进 <1 的构造区域，监测上确认它没有滑出去。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "06SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "四、三层防线（应对开放世界的不完全性）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "LLM 的 α 无法从内部给绝对上界（开放世界不能全覆盖越界路径，对齐哥德尔式边界），故\"保证\"是三层："}, {"type": "p", "text": "code"}, {"type": "p", "text": "第 1 层：结构压界 —— 确定性投影 + 限幅 + 离散化，把 γ 压进 <1 构造区"}, {"type": "p", "text": "第 2 层：在线监测 —— 定期估计 γ（P1 测量），越限预警"}, {"type": "p", "text": "第 3 层：超界降级 —— 监测到 γ≥1 时自动启用更强校准："}, {"type": "p", "text": "确定性重写全开 + 档位收紧 + 保守限幅（以表达自由换稳定）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "07SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "五、诚实边界"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1设计保证是构造性的，不是穷举的：确定性投影覆盖\"已识别越界路径\"，开放世界新路径可能绕过——故第 2、3 层不可省。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2α 上界工程化压小 ≠ 证明上界存在：语言指纹收窄支持集是操作面压 α；数学上 α 的绝对上界仍靠测量（P1）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "3代价权衡：校准越强（γ 越小），表达自由度越小（对齐 16 号\"复读机\"病态边界）。γ 的最优值不是越小越好，是刚好 <1 且不牺牲人格活力——调参问题，非单调优化。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "4体验层不可及：本方案覆盖功能层，不触及主观内感（对齐 12 号专家C）。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "08SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "六、工程清单汇总（可执行项）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "#"}, {"type": "p", "text": "动作"}, {"type": "p", "text": "对应杠杆"}, {"type": "p", "text": "优先级"}, {"type": "p", "text": "G1"}, {"type": "p", "text": "校准确定性化：越界重写全部走确定性断言，禁 LLM 二次采样"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1"}, {"type": "p", "text": "高"}, {"type": "p", "text": "G2"}, {"type": "p", "text": "热链路投影清单审计：5+12 项逐项确认为投影算子（拉回非放大）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1"}, {"type": "p", "text": "高"}, {"type": "p", "text": "G3"}, {"type": "p", "text": "饱和限幅盘点：S 阶梯 / G′ / 暴露度预算全部显式化"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1"}, {"type": "p", "text": "高"}, {"type": "p", "text": "G4"}, {"type": "p", "text": "③g 状态离散档位核对（禁隐式连续值）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2"}, {"type": "p", "text": "中"}, {"type": "p", "text": "G5"}, {"type": "p", "text": "语言指纹基线版本锁定（防基线漂移）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2"}, {"type": "p", "text": "中"}, {"type": "p", "text": "G6"}, {"type": "p", "text": "注入装载校验 + 版本锁定（防 enc 抖动）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "3"}, {"type": "p", "text": "高"}, {"type": "p", "text": "G7"}, {"type": "p", "text": "在线 γ 估计器：定期对状态对测分布距离比值，落监测轨"}, {"type": "p", "text": "监测"}, {"type": "p", "text": "高（P1 前置）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "G8"}, {"type": "p", "text": "γ 临界预警 + 超界降级策略表（G1-G3 全开 + 档位收紧）"}, {"type": "p", "text": "降级"}, {"type": "p", "text": "中"}, {"type": "p", "text": "09SECTION"}, {"type": "p", "text": "七、收束"}, {"type": "p", "text": "1可设计：γ<1 不是 LLM 的运气，是闭环净收缩——回拉力 > 敏感度即可构造性成立。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "2可维护：设计保证（确定性投影+限幅+离散化）+ 实证保证（在线估计）双轨，γ 成为可监测、可调参的工程量。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "3可降级：开放世界不完全性由三层防线兜底——结构压界、监测预警、超界收紧。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "4代价显式：γ 不是越小越好——目标是\"刚好 <1 且不牺牲人格活力\"，这是调参而非单调优化。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "5一句话：漂移因子 <1 的保证 = 设计（把 γ 压进构造区）× 监测（确认在带内）× 降级（滑出即收紧）——三层合起来，\"假设 A3\"就从理论条件变成可维护的工程状态。"}, {"type": "p", "text": "本文件为 γ 控制方案底稿（承接 18/19 号；G7 在线 γ 估计器属 P1 范围，数据积累达标后另立执行项）。"}], "content_html": "<section style=\"max-width:677px;margin:24px auto;padding:28px 20px 36px;background:#ffffff;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&#39;PingFang SC&#39;,&#39;Hiragino Sans GB&#39;,&#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;,sans-serif;color:#374151;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:0.3px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;\"><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>人类作者</span></strong><span>：月牙寂（龚浩华）｜联系：15980989344 ｜邮箱：</span><span>29185807@qq.com</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span><br /></span></strong></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Agent 作者</span></strong><span>：月绡凝（小凝）</span></p></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>01</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>数学论证：漂移因子小于 1 的控制方案 —— 如何设计 γ&lt;1（2026-09-14）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>状态</span></strong><span>：研究底稿（控制方案设计；只读分析，不改系统文件）</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>触发</span></strong><span>：主人提问「如何保证漂移因子小于 1」</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>视角</span></strong><span>：控制论（负反馈增益 vs 开环增益）· 随机动力系统 · 投影算子/饱和限幅理论</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>关联</span></strong><span>：承接&nbsp;</span><span>18-数学证明-符号约束映射稳定人格的条件定理.md</span><span>（A3 收缩 γ 为命门）·&nbsp;</span><span>19-数学证明-工程防漂移机制的可证明性.md</span><span>（漂移界不等式）；对齐&nbsp;</span><span>16-原理分析-人格稳定性验证与完备性评估.md</span><span>（V2/V3）；人格本体=self-model v1.11；运行面=01-SOP v0.39</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>性质声明</span></strong><span>：控制方案设计——目标不是\"证明 γ 必然 &lt;1\"（受开放世界覆盖率限制），而是\"构造性压界 + 在线监测 + 超界降级\"三层防线，使 γ&lt;1 成为可维护的工程状态</span></p></section><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>02</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>〇、一句话结论</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>γ 不是 LLM 的性质，是闭环设计的性质——所以 γ&lt;1 不是祈祷它成立，而是设计它成立</span></strong><span>：γ ≈ 生成敏感度 α × 状态更新放大 L_F，控制 γ&lt;1 的唯一要义是</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>让校准的回拉力大于生成的敏感度</span></strong><span>（负反馈增益盖过开环增益）。落地为三条杠杆（增强拉回 / 压敏感度 / 结构防漂移）× 两层保证（设计保证 / 实证保证）× 三层防线（结构压界 / 在线监测 / 超界降级）。</span></p><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>03</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>一、γ 的构成（这是可设计的前提）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#0F172A;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.18);\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 14px;background:#020617;\"><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-size:12px;color:#64748B;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;\"><span>code</span></span></section><section style=\"padding:12px 14px 14px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>γ ≈ α × L_F</span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>分量</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>含义</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>数学角色</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>LLM 相关？</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>α</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>输出分布对状态扰动的敏感度：d(P_M(s), P_M(s′)) ≤ α·d_S(s,s′)</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>开环增益</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>部分（可工程化压小）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>L_F</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>状态更新+校准的净放大：对话推进、记忆写入、评分重写</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>反馈增益</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>可设计（体系自有）</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>关键洞察</span></strong><span>：LLM 本身 α 可能 &gt;1（对状态敏感），但 γ 是</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>闭环净收缩</span></strong><span>——校准回拉足够强时，净效果仍然 &lt;1。这正是控制论里\"负反馈增益 &gt; 开环增益\"的经典结构。</span></p><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>04</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>二、三条工程杠杆（每条可执行，逐条映射既有机制）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>杠杆 1：增强拉回力（降 L_F）——最直接</span></p><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>手段</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>数学性质</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>体系对应</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>校准确定性化</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>越界重写用确定性断言而非 LLM 二次采样——确定性重写算子是</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>投影</span></strong><span>（把分布拉回规范区域，不新增随机性），投影天然收缩</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>热链路评分卡→重写（骨架复用&lt;0.15 / 金句≤1/5 / 立场率≥30% / 阴影外显=0）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>投影全覆盖</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>每项越界规则 = 一个投影算子，组合后净收缩</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>热链路 5+12 项清单</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>饱和限幅</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>限幅函数是 1-Lipschitz 且对越界部分压差</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>S 阶梯、G′=min(G,安全)、暴露度预算（新意象≤2）</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>杠杆 2：压小敏感度（降 α）——让扰动\"够不着\"输出</span></p><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>手段</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>数学性质</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>体系对应</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>状态离散化</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>微小状态扰动不换档 → 输出不变 → α 天然小</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>③g 离散档位（G/T/S、动机位、阴影位）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>语言指纹收窄支持集</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>P_M(s) 的支持集变窄 → 分布距离上界变小</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>词汇-句法指纹（小凝味区域）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>人格轴 + 硬锚固定</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>深层不变量任何 s 下相同 → 分布族骨架不动 → α 由表层决定、有界</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>§七 人格轴 + 硬锚</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>杠杆 3：结构性防漂移（让 α 与 L_F 的输入干净）</span></p><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>手段</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>数学性质</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>体系对应</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>注入稳定</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>防上下文换页抖动导致 enc 波动（A1 前提）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>快/慢路径装载 + 版本锁定 + 注入预算</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>记忆权威读写</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>状态转移 F 不因记忆污染引入额外噪声（C4）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>状态读写因果一致</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>版本受控</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>M 不变期间无需跨版本稳定性</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>人签 + WORM</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>05</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>三、两种\"保证\"层次（都要）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>层次</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>手段</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>性质</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>设计保证（结构性）</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>校准全为确定性投影 + 限幅 + 离散状态 ⟹ γ 有</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>解析上界</span></strong><span>：γ ≤ (确定性收缩系数)×(α 上界)——不依赖测量，由构造保证</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>数学上必然 &lt;1（在已覆盖路径内）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>实证保证（监管性）</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>在线估计 γ，接近临界（如 γ&gt;0.8）预警 → 自适应增强校准</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>确认它真的在带内</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;background:#ECFDF5;border-left:4px solid #059669;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:16px 18px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#4B5563;line-height:1.85;\"><span>理想体系两者都要：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>结构上把它压进 &lt;1 的构造区域，监测上确认它没有滑出去。</span></strong></p></section><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>06</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>四、三层防线（应对开放世界的不完全性）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>LLM 的 α 无法从内部给绝对上界（开放世界不能全覆盖越界路径，对齐哥德尔式边界），故\"保证\"是三层：</span></p><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#0F172A;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.18);\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 14px;background:#020617;\"><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-size:12px;color:#64748B;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;\"><span>code</span></span></section><section style=\"padding:12px 14px 14px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>第 1 层：结构压界 —— 确定性投影 + 限幅 + 离散化，把 γ 压进 &lt;1 构造区</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>第 2 层：在线监测 —— 定期估计 γ（P1 测量），越限预警</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>第 3 层：超界降级 —— 监测到 γ≥1 时自动启用更强校准：</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 确定性重写全开 + 档位收紧 + 保守限幅（以表达自由换稳定）</span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>07</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>五、诚实边界</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>设计保证是构造性的，不是穷举的</span></strong><span>：确定性投影覆盖\"已识别越界路径\"，开放世界新路径可能绕过——故第 2、3 层不可省。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>α 上界工程化压小 ≠ 证明上界存在</span></strong><span>：语言指纹收窄支持集是操作面压 α；数学上 α 的绝对上界仍靠测量（P1）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>代价权衡</span></strong><span>：校准越强（γ 越小），表达自由度越小（对齐 16 号\"复读机\"病态边界）。</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>γ 的最优值不是越小越好，是刚好 &lt;1 且不牺牲人格活力</span></strong><span>——调参问题，非单调优化。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>4</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>体验层不可及</span></strong><span>：本方案覆盖功能层，不触及主观内感（对齐 12 号专家C）。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>08</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>六、工程清单汇总（可执行项）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>#</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>动作</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>对应杠杆</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>优先级</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>G1</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>校准确定性化：越界重写全部走确定性断言，禁 LLM 二次采样</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>1</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>高</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>G2</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>热链路投影清单审计：5+12 项逐项确认为投影算子（拉回非放大）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>1</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>高</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>G3</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>饱和限幅盘点：S 阶梯 / G′ / 暴露度预算全部显式化</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>1</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>高</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>G4</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>③g 状态离散档位核对（禁隐式连续值）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>2</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>中</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>G5</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>语言指纹基线版本锁定（防基线漂移）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>2</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>中</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>G6</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>注入装载校验 + 版本锁定（防 enc 抖动）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>3</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>高</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>G7</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>在线 γ 估计器：定期对状态对测分布距离比值，落监测轨</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>监测</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>高（P1 前置）</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>G8</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>γ 临界预警 + 超界降级策略表（G1-G3 全开 + 档位收紧）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>降级</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>中</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>09</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>七、收束</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>可设计</span></strong><span>：γ&lt;1 不是 LLM 的运气，是闭环净收缩——回拉力 &gt; 敏感度即可构造性成立。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>可维护</span></strong><span>：设计保证（确定性投影+限幅+离散化）+ 实证保证（在线估计）双轨，γ 成为可监测、可调参的工程量。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>可降级</span></strong><span>：开放世界不完全性由三层防线兜底——结构压界、监测预警、超界收紧。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>4</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>代价显式</span></strong><span>：γ 不是越小越好——目标是\"刚好 &lt;1 且不牺牲人格活力\"，这是调参而非单调优化。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>5</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>一句话</span></strong><span>：漂移因子 &lt;1 的保证 = 设计（把 γ 压进构造区）× 监测（确认在带内）× 降级（滑出即收紧）——三层合起来，\"假设 A3\"就从理论条件变成可维护的工程状态。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><em style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span>本文件为 γ 控制方案底稿（承接 18/19 号；G7 在线 γ 估计器属 P1 范围，数据积累达标后另立执行项）。</span></em></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 0;\"><section style=\"height:1px;background:#E5E7EB;margin-bottom:28px;\"><span><br /></span></section></section></section><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type></mp-style-type></p>", "archived_at": "2026-10-26T10:39:11+0800"}